## Component Architecture

### Atoms

- `Button.tsx` - Reusable button with 5 variants (primary, secondary, white, outline, danger)
- `BackButton.tsx` - Navigation back button using outline Button + icon

### Molecules

- `Balance.tsx` - Wallet balance display with WART token and USD value
- `WalletInfo.tsx` - Wallet address display with copy functionality and explorer link
- `ProfileHeader.tsx` - User avatar (Jazzicon), name, account path, and settings menu
- `ActionButtons.tsx` - Send/Receive action buttons row
- `TabNavigation.tsx` - Assets/Activity tabs with underline indicator

### Organisms

- `TokenItem.tsx` - Token row with logo, name, balance, and USD value
- `ActivityItem.tsx` - Transaction row with date, action, amount, and USD
- `UserDropdown.tsx` - Account switcher with Jazzicon avatars
- `NetworkDropdown.tsx` - Network selector with swap functionality
- `NodeCard.tsx` - Network node display with latency and delete
- `AccountCard.tsx` - Account list item with selection state
- `Header.tsx` - Page header with back button and title

### Pages

- `Home.tsx` - Main wallet view with balance, actions, tabs
- `LockScreen.tsx` - Password unlock screen
- `SendPage.tsx` - Send transaction form
- `ReceivePage.tsx` - Receive address display with QR
- `AccountDetails.tsx` - Account settings
- `ManageAccounts.tsx` - Account management
- `SelectNode.tsx` - Node selection
- `SetPassword.tsx` - Password setup
- `startedPage.tsx` - Landing page (Create/Import)
- `intro.tsx` - Onboarding intro
- `importPage.tsx` - Import wallet
- `RecoveryPhase.tsx` - Recovery phrase display
- `validate.tsx` - Recovery phrase validation
- `validateIntro.tsx` - Validation instructions

### Context

- `WalletContext.tsx` - Global wallet state (seed phrase, wallet address, password, auth token, accounts, nodes)
- `useWallet` hook - Access to wallet context with helpers

