## Tech Stack

- **Framework:** React 18.3 + TypeScript 5.6
- **Build Tool:** Vite 5.4
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 3.4
- **Routing:** React Router DOM 6.28
- **State:** React Context + useWallet custom hook
- **Icons:** react-icons 5.3 (Fa, Io, Ai icon sets)
- **Avatars:** react-jazzicon for deterministic account icons
- **Crypto:** ethers 6.13, @noble/hashes, secp256k1, elliptic, ripemd160
- **BIP:** bip39 for mnemonic generation
- **HTTP:** axios for API calls
- **Extension:** webextension-polyfill for browser extension APIs
- **QR Codes:** qrcode.react

---

## Common Patterns

### Copy to Clipboard
```tsx
const copyToClipboard = useCallback((text: string) => {
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
}, []);
```

### Number Input (hide spinner)
```tsx
className="no-spinner"  // CSS: -moz-appearance: textfield, -webkit-appearance: none
```

### Jazzicon Usage
```tsx
import Jazzicon from "react-jazzicon/dist/Jazzicon";
<Jazzicon diameter={48} seed={selectedWalletIndex} />
```

### Wallet Address Formatting
```tsx
import { formatWalletAddress } from "../utils";
// Formats: "0x1234...abcd" (first 6 + last 4 chars)
```

### Extension Dimensions Enforcement
```css
html, body {
  height: 600px;
  width: 410px;
  background-color: black;
}
html::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
html { scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none; }
